                      "content": "ClearC 会清理哪些类型的文件？",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "wt5ZR",
                      "name": "faq1ACn",
                      "fill": "#64748B",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": 752,
                      "content": "ClearC 主要清理开发缓存文件，如 node_modules、Go 模块缓存、Python __pycache__、Rust target 目录以及其他临时构建产物。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 14
                    }
                  ]
                },
